{
    "title": "Magic Beauty Makeup Camera",
    "description": "Instant make your desired photo more beautiful, give yourself a full magic virtual makeover, and take your selfie photo with a magic camera. It\u2019s professionally designed by our experts to enhance the best pictures and selfie photos for a perfect.\r\n\r\nMagic selfie beauty camera is powered by AI to perfectly face tune selfies. Edit photos like a pro and have flawless selfies with the makeover app. amazing photo editing tools such as neon spirals and drip effects will take your pics art experience to the next level. Fabulous picture editor and face editor also offers a beauty camera for auto retouch or snapping selfies with funny selfie camera filters.\r\n\r\nPretty Makeup Camera | Filter Makeup Photo Editor is a beauty photo editor, \ud83d\ude18for you with a makeup function and you can make your face more beautiful. Share your perfect selfies on social media to get more love and likes.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc60Retouch photos to adjust skin tone, add filters, easily remove wrinkles, add freckles & contours eraser pimples edit tired eyes, and reshape your face and look thinner in just a few touches. Your skin will look indeed radiant in all of your selfies and photos! \ud83d\udc84\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8bReal-Time\ud83d\udc59\r\nMakeover and beauty and cute in real-time beautifying effects and filters make you look perfect in every photo and the special motion stickers make your photo more cute and cool.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc85\u25b2 Eyebrows, Eye Shadow, Eye Liner Eyelashes, Blush Eye Lids, Eye Color, Foundation Lip Color, and Contour\ud83d\udc44 Get the virtual makeover camera and create great beauty makeup selfies.\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fSkin Editor\r\n- Brighten or tan your skin is now just a tap away, achieve perfect skin, glowing perfection\r\n- Retouch skin tone using our specially developed skin smoothing tool just for you!\r\n- Each one provides different levels of smoothing toning and also removing temporary imperfections such as pimples and blemishes for smoother and flawless skin!\r\n- Use darkening effects to retouch your photos.\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fSlimming\r\n- Reshape your face, and look thinner with just a few touches.\r\n- Add contours to your selfie to bring out your true beauty.\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fRemove Blemishes\r\n- Retouch, brighten and even tan your skin to look perfect\r\n- Eliminate unwanted pimples and spots with a simple tap\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fDark circles\r\n- Eye Bag Remover diminishes dark under-eye circles and reduces puffiness\r\n- Erase bags and dark circles under your eyes\r\n- Our \u201cBRIGHTEN\u201d feature enhances your eyes to instantly light up your features.\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fBright Eyes\r\n- Instantly bring out the beautiful contrast of your eyes to instantly light up your selfie with \u201cBrighten\u201d\r\n- make your eyes pop in photos with Pretty Camera-Selfie Filter Makeup Photo Editor\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fCreate The Perfect Smile\r\n- You want a smiley face or enhance your smile just a tap away now bring out the natural beauty in your smile\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0f\u2764\ufe0fPretty Makeup Camera is a professional photo editor for your facial photos. Lighten and Darken acne enlarge brighten dark circle slimming satin with all operations made automatically!\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fUse Pretty Camera-Selfie Filter Make Up Photo Editor to edit your selfie including Removing blemishes, whitening skin, removing eye-bag, and many more!\r\n\r\nSay goodbye to fake faces and start taking a perfect image using a Pretty camera for candy selfies that make your pictures more natural and beautiful!\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0f ACCESSORIES:\r\nYou can different 3D stickers, text, captions, one-liners, and quotes on your pictures. You can add jewelry, tattoos, diamond, glasses, and earrings.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc51 The special advantages magic beauty camera\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Simple interface, easy to use\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Photo face makeup app editor HD, save high-quality photos, doesn't break photos after editing\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Professional photo capturing, beauty magic makeover photo editor, and one-tap tool\r\n\r\nNo longer need to sit for hours of makeup to get a beautiful makeup selfie, Christmas photo editor for example. Now, selfies will be easy with this app, with just a few small steps you can get pictures with the newest makeup face app trends.",
